an get twice the result with half the effort. Both sides can control the variable elements in the map to form parts of terrain advantages.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1081560/extras/e87a700d3ec8ea008ea3a195a4070d3f.poster.avif?t=1611026204\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1081560/extras/e87a700d3ec8ea008ea3a195a4070d3f.webm?t=1611026204\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1081560/extras/e87a700d3ec8ea008ea3a195a4070d3f.mp4?t=1611026204\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Unique character images</strong></h2>Transformed humans (Extractors) are carrying extraordinary missions, their skills have their own advantages. Choose an machine elite (Watcher) that suits you, fight alongside with him in the project &quot;Gold Express&quot;!<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1081560/extras/08b385a46435c561bb99cdb1a542bb2a.poster.avif?t=1611026204\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1081560/extras/08b385a46435c561bb99cdb1a542bb2a.webm?t=1611026204\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1081560/extras/08b385a46435c561bb99cdb1a542bb2a.mp4?t=1611026204\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Upgraded combat pace</strong></h2>The intense competition will bring you a smooth gaming experience.<br>Now, step into the frenzied Arena and start your fateful journey!",
